<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>{$name} - 插件首页</title>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container-fluid p-4">
        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-header">
                <h4 class="card-title">{$name} 插件</h4>
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
                <p class="text-muted">插件开发模板，在此基础上开始构建你的功能。</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>版本: {$version}</li>
                    <li>作者: {$author}</li>
                    <li>创建时间: {$create_time}</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
